        "Site-find pairs: Mohenjo-daro (Great Bath, Pashupati seal, Dancing Girl), Lothal (dockyard), Kalibangan (ploughed field, fire altars), Dholavira (reservoirs, signboard), Rakhigarhi (largest site in India).",
        "Buddha's life mnemonic L-B-S-K: Lumbini (birth), Bodh Gaya (enlightenment), Sarnath (first sermon), Kushinagar (death). Symbols: lotus, Bodhi tree, wheel, stupa.",
