        "Plassey 1757 = Clive versus Siraj-ud-Daulah (won by Mir Jafar's treachery); Buxar 1764 = Munro versus Mir Qasim, Shuja-ud-Daulah and Shah Alam II together. Buxar was the bigger result: it gave the Diwani (Treaty of Allahabad, 1765).",
