          "answer": "(C) Saadat Khan Burhan-ul-Mulk. Saadat Khan Burhan-ul-Mulk was appointed governor of Awadh by the Mughal emperor in 1722 and made the province practically independent. Wajid Ali Shah was the last Nawab."
