        "Formation date to lock in: 1 November 1956 (state formed), 1 November 2000 (Chhattisgarh carved out). Same date, 44 years apart.",
        "Three UNESCO World Heritage Sites (as of 2026), all with letters S, K, B: Sanchi (Buddhist stupa), Khajuraho (Chandela temples), Bhimbetka (rock shelters).",
