        "Social studies = the integrated school subject; social sciences = the parent disciplines (history, geography, political science, economics, sociology).",
        "In pedagogy scenario questions, the answer that keeps the child active, builds on prior knowledge, offers multiple perspectives and treats the textbook as one resource is usually the one consistent with NCF 2005."
